---
title: useSessionStorage
description: Reactive SessionStorage.
---

## Usage

```ts
import { useSessionStorage } from 'svelte-borya'

// bind boolean
const flag = useSessionStorage('my-flag', true)
console.log(flag.value) // true 
```

## Type
```ts
export function useSessionStorage<T>(
  key: string,
  initialValue: MaybeGetter<T>,
  options: UseStorageOptions<T> = {}
): { value: T } 
```

Please refer to [useStorage](/functions/useStorage).